  "resume": "This is a radio broadcast recording from the Swiss Radio DRS program 'Echo der Zeit' dated 24 July 1948, covering the International Gliding Meeting in Samedan. It includes an introduction by Douglas, interviews with Hofstettler, pilot reports in French, English, and German, and meteorological and flight commentary. The program documents the events and technical aspects of the gliding competition."
